title: Commodities, Savings and Foreign Currency
description: IAL 4.3.6 · 2a: primary exporters' terms of trade declining (Prebisch-Singer), the Harrod-Domar savings gap, and the foreign currency gap, all for one economy.
checklist: Terms of trade = export price index ÷ import price index × 100 = 75
checklist: Harrod-Domar: growth = 12% ÷ 4 = 3%; 6% needs 24% saving
checklist: Savings gap: 12 points of GDP
checklist: Foreign currency gap: imports needed $14bn against exports of $12bn
